---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title="Profile | Jihoo" description="A profile of Jihoo and the ideas behind this independent notebook." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="page-lead wrap" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
        <span class="eyebrow">PROFILE / ABOUT THE AUTHOR</span>
        <h1 id="profile-title">A practice of<br /><em>curiosity.</em></h1>
        <p>Some context for the person behind this archive, and the questions that keep it going.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="about-editorial wrap" aria-label="About Jihoo">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">BIOGRAPHICAL NOTE / 001</span>
          <h2>Learning by making,<br />thinking by writing.</h2>
          <p class="first-line">Hello, I'm Jihoo. I enjoy learning new things and turning abstract ideas into something I can explore, test, and understand.</p>
          <p>My interests move between software, small creative experiments, and the everyday observations that spark new questions. I tend to learn best by building, paying attention to what happens, and taking notes along the way.</p>
          <p>This site is a place to keep those notes in order. It is not a formal academic record or a list of finished answers; it is a living archive of works in progress.</p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:64px">Working principles</h2>
          <ol class="principles">
            <li><strong>01</strong><span>Begin with a question worth exploring.</span></li>
            <li><strong>02</strong><span>Make something small enough to test.</span></li>
            <li><strong>03</strong><span>Record what worked, what did not, and why.</span></li>
            <li><strong>04</strong><span>Revise the idea, then begin again.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <aside class="profile-aside" aria-label="Profile illustration and links">
          <figure>
            <img src="/images/jihoo-hero.webp" alt="A smiling illustrated character walking through a field of flowers" width="1293" height="1217" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption>PLATE II / A PERSONAL ILLUSTRATION FROM THE ARCHIVE</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <dl class="aside-info">
            <div><dt>Name</dt><dd>Jihoo</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Areas of interest</dt><dd>Software, making, documentation</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Notebook</dt><dd><a href="/blog/">Browse the writing index ↗</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Code & correspondence</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/jihoo12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/jihoo12 ↗</a></dd></div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
